---
import BaseLayout from "../layouts/BaseLayout.astro";
import Navbar from "../components/Navbar.astro";
---

<BaseLayout>
  <Navbar />

  <div class="pt-24 md:pt-32 px-6 flex-grow">
    <div class="mx-auto max-w-5xl">
      
      <!-- HERO / INTRO SECTION -->
      <header class="py-12 md:py-16 border-b border-[#607264]/10">
        <span class="text-xs uppercase tracking-[0.3em] text-[#607264] font-semibold">Continuous Root-Cause Guidance & Personal Care Plans</span>
        <h1 class="text-3xl md:text-5xl font-bold mt-2 text-[#3c2f2f]">Vitality & Functional Wellness Roadmap</h1>
        
        <div class="mt-8 max-w-3xl space-y-6 text-[#1e2f23]/90 leading-relaxed text-base md:text-lg">
          <p class="font-medium text-[#3c2f2f] text-lg md:text-xl italic">
            Standard healthcare frequently overlooks the deep, ongoing physiological, emotional, and rhythmic needs of women across different life stages.
          </p>
          <p>
            Whether you are preparing for pregnancy, recovering from a major life event or illness, navigating perimenopause and menopause, or simply feeling depleted and seeking clear answers, true vitality requires time, root-cause investigation, and deeply individualized care.
          </p>
          <p>
            We center on one core truth: You deserve to be fully listened to, and your unique health story requires a custom-built pathway to wellness. Lasting health goes beyond test results—it requires examining how you think, move, and structure your days. A central pillar of our work together is identifying and reframing limiting beliefs, transforming self-sabotaging patterns, and engaging in deliberate habit evolution through habit stacking and automization. Equally essential is honoring cyclical living—tuning into the natural rhythms of our bodies and seasons (whether actively cycling menstrually or not) to cultivate a sustainable balance between work, pleasure, giving, and receiving.
          </p>
        </div>
      </header>

      <!-- PROGRAM OPTIONS & STRUCTURE -->
      <section class="py-12 md:py-16 border-b border-[#607264]/10">
        <span class="text-xs uppercase tracking-[0.3em] text-[#607264] font-semibold">Structure</span>
        <h2 class="text-2xl md:text-4xl font-bold mt-2 text-[#3c2f2f]">Program Options & Structure</h2>
        <p class="mt-4 text-base md:text-lg text-[#1e2f23]/90 max-w-3xl">
          You may begin your vitality journey at any stage. All standard consultations take place once per month for 90 minutes and can be held in-person at the office or virtually via Zoom. Every client receives a completely tailored care package designed around their specific goals, body systems, and lifestyle design.
        </p>

        <div class="grid gap-6 md:grid-cols-2 mt-8">
          <div class="p-6 rounded-2xl bg-[#f4f6f4] border border-[#607264]/10 flex flex-col justify-between">
            <div>
              <h3 class="text-xl font-bold text-[#3c2f2f] mb-2">Option 1: 6-Month Intensive</h3>
              <p class="text-xs uppercase tracking-wider text-[#607264] font-semibold mb-4">6 Monthly 90-min Sessions</p>
              <p class="text-base text-[#1e2f23]/80">
                Focused, foundational support covering comprehensive lab analysis, blood sugar and mineral balancing, gut restorative protocols, limiting belief reframing, habit building, nervous system grounding, and tailored lifestyle integration.
              </p>
            </div>
          </div>

          <div class="p-6 rounded-2xl bg-[#f4f6f4] border border-[#607264]/10 flex flex-col justify-between">
            <div>
              <h3 class="text-xl font-bold text-[#3c2f2f] mb-2">Option 2: 12-Month Comprehensive</h3>
              <p class="text-xs uppercase tracking-wider text-[#607264] font-semibold mb-4">12 Monthly 90-min Sessions</p>
              <p class="text-base text-[#1e2f23]/80">
                Full-year continuous care to deeply restore, rebuild, automate and stack new habits, and optimize long-term health. Integrates foundational functional testing, hormone and cycle alignment, belief transformation, somatic self-care instruction, seasonal/cyclical wellness shifts, and comprehensive vitality planning.
              </p>
            </div>
          </div>
        </div>
      </section>

      <!-- CORE PACKAGE COMPONENTS -->
      <section class="py-12 md:py-16 border-b border-[#607264]/10">
        <span class="text-xs uppercase tracking-[0.3em] text-[#607264] font-semibold">Foundation</span>
        <h2 class="text-2xl md:text-4xl font-bold mt-2 text-[#3c2f2f]">Core Package Components</h2>

        <!-- Component 1: Lab Testing -->
        <div class="mt-8 max-w-3xl space-y-6 text-[#1e2f23]/90 text-base md:text-lg">
          <h3 class="text-xl font-bold text-[#3c2f2f]">1. Foundational Functional Lab Testing</h3>
          <p>
            In functional wellness, true root-cause healing begins at the foundation. Before evaluating complex hormone cascades, we prioritize stabilizing blood sugar regulation, mineral levels, and gut health. When these base systems are balanced, metabolic energy stabilizes and your body builds the resilience required for lasting vitality. Included in your package price is a baseline lab panel:
          </p>

          <ul class="space-y-4 pl-4 border-l-2 border-[#607264]/30">
            <li>
              <strong>Comprehensive Blood Panel:</strong> Evaluates liver/kidney function (CMP), blood sugar & insulin markers (glucose regulation), full mineral & electrolyte balance, complete thyroid panel (TSH, Free T3, Free T4, Reverse T3, antibodies), inflammation and histamine markers, and total iron & ferritin status to assess stamina and systemic oxygenation.
            </li>
            <li>
              <strong>Diagnostic Solutions GI-MAP® (DNA Stool Analysis):</strong> Utilizing quantitative PCR (qPCR) technology, this advanced test measures microbial DNA to provide an accurate, high-resolution quantitative look at your gut ecosystem. Rather than just noting presence or absence, it reveals precise microbial loads. It comprehensively evaluates:
              <ul class="mt-2 space-y-2 pl-4 text-sm md:text-base list-disc list-inside text-[#607264]">
                <li><strong>Pathogens & Dysbiotic Microbes:</strong> Bacterial, viral, and parasitic pathogens, alongside opportunistic bacterial overgrowths.</li>
                <li><strong>H. pylori & Virulence Factors:</strong> Identifies H. pylori colonization along with specific genetic virulence factors and antibiotic resistance markers.</li>
                <li><strong>Commensal Microbiome:</strong> Quantifies your beneficial, keystone bacteria essential for nutrient extraction, vitamin production, and immune protection.</li>
                <li><strong>Fungi & Yeast:</strong> Assesses Candida and other fungal overgrowths.</li>
                <li><strong>Intestinal Health Markers:</strong> Measures digestive enzyme output (Pancreatic Elastase-1), gut mucosal immunity (Secretory IgA), intestinal inflammation (Calprotectin), gluten reactivity (Anti-Gliadin sIgA), and gut barrier integrity/intestinal permeability (Zonulin).</li>
              </ul>
            </li>
          </ul>

          <div class="p-6 bg-[#f4f6f4] rounded-2xl border border-[#607264]/10 space-y-4 mt-6">
            <h4 class="text-lg font-bold text-[#3c2f2f]">The Clinical Power of Pairing Bloodwork + GI-MAP</h4>
            <p class="text-sm md:text-base">
              Analyzing stool and blood together bridges the gap between internal systemic delivery and digestive absorption:
            </p>
            <ul class="space-y-3 text-sm md:text-base text-[#1e2f23]/90">
              <li><strong>Connecting Absorption to Blood Stores:</strong> Serum ferritin or electrolytes may read low on blood work, but the GI-MAP reveals why—showing whether poor digestive capacity (low elastase), low mucosal immunity, or parasitic/bacterial competition is blocking nutrient uptake.</li>
              <li><strong>Connecting Gut Inflammation to Systemic Symptoms:</strong> Blood markers highlight metabolic or thyroid strain, while the GI-MAP pinpoints the upstream root cause—such as dysbiosis or a compromised gut barrier ("leaky gut") driving systemic inflammation, brain fog, fatigue, or auto-antibodies.</li>
            </ul>
          </div>
        </div>

        <!-- Additional Components Grid -->
        <div class="grid gap-6 md:grid-cols-2 mt-10">
          <div class="p-6 bg-[#f4f6f4] rounded-2xl border border-[#607264]/10 space-y-3">
            <h3 class="text-lg font-bold text-[#3c2f2f]">2. Personalized Nutritional & Herbal Roadmap</h3>
            <ul class="space-y-2 text-sm md:text-base text-[#607264]">
              <li><strong>Food-First Nutrient Density:</strong> Custom strategies tailored to your metabolic type, emphasizing bioavailable proteins, healthy fats, restorative whole foods, and specific micronutrients. We also utilize supplements when appropriate.</li>
              <li><strong>Ferritin & Mineral Optimization:</strong> Precision protocols to rebuild depleted nutrient stores gently and effectively.</li>
              <li><strong>Custom Herbal Formulations:</strong> Crafting custom teas, tinctures, and tonics to support adrenal health, sleep depth, digestion, and hormone balance.</li>
            </ul>
          </div>

          <div class="p-6 bg-[#f4f6f4] rounded-2xl border border-[#607264]/10 space-y-3">
            <h3 class="text-lg font-bold text-[#3c2f2f]">3. Somatic & Pelvic Health Guidance</h3>
            <ul class="space-y-2 text-sm md:text-base text-[#607264]">
              <li><strong>Nervous System Regulation:</strong> Integrated instruction in vagal nerve toning, manual lymphatic drainage, and daily grounding exercises.</li>
              <li><strong>Pelvic & Core Alignment:</strong> Targeted self-care practices to support pelvic bowl tone, abdominal vitality, and physical alignment.</li>
            </ul>
          </div>

          <div class="p-6 bg-[#f4f6f4] rounded-2xl border border-[#607264]/10 space-y-3">
            <h3 class="text-lg font-bold text-[#3c2f2f]">4. Mindset, Habit Evolution & Cyclical Living</h3>
            <ul class="space-y-2 text-sm md:text-base text-[#607264]">
              <li><strong>Belief Architecture & Re-Framing:</strong> Uncovering and actively reframing deeply ingested limiting beliefs that block personal healing, agency, or self-care priorities.</li>
              <li><strong>Habit Stacking & Automization:</strong> Applying strategic behavioral design to stack new, nourishing health routines onto existing practices until they become effortless, automated daily rituals.</li>
              <li><strong>Living in Natural Cycles:</strong> Aligning your energy, food, and daily commitments with macro and micro cycles—whether tracking a menstrual cycle, seasonal shifts, or broader life rhythms—ensuring all people learn to honor natural ebb and flow.</li>
              <li><strong>The Life-Balance Spectrum:</strong> Re-calibrating the continuous exchange between work, active giving, restful receiving, and genuine, unguarded pleasure.</li>
            </ul>
          </div>

          <div class="p-6 bg-[#f4f6f4] rounded-2xl border border-[#607264]/10 space-y-3">
            <h3 class="text-lg font-bold text-[#3c2f2f]">5. Cycle Alignment & Life Stage Optimization</h3>
            <ul class="space-y-2 text-sm md:text-base text-[#607264]">
              <li><strong>Fertility & Preconception Prep:</strong> Supporting optimal egg quality, uterine lining, and systemic balance for prospective pregnancy.</li>
              <li><strong>Cycle & Hormone Tracking:</strong> Educational guidance on understanding body signals, ovulation markers, and supporting natural hormone transitions.</li>
              <li><strong>Perimenopause & Menopause Navigation:</strong> Targeted care to ease hormonal shifts, support cognitive function, preserve bone density, and optimize body composition.</li>
            </ul>
          </div>
        </div>
      </section>

      <!-- TAILORED CARE: WHAT WE COVER TOGETHER -->
      <section class="py-12 md:py-16 border-b border-[#607264]/10">
        <span class="text-xs uppercase tracking-[0.3em] text-[#607264] font-semibold">Dynamic Sessions</span>
        <h2 class="text-2xl md:text-4xl font-bold mt-2 text-[#3c2f2f]">Tailored Care: What We Cover Together</h2>
        <p class="mt-4 text-base md:text-lg text-[#1e2f23]/90 max-w-3xl">
          Because every woman enters care with a distinct history and unique goals, our monthly sessions are never bound to a rigid, fixed template. We address your needs dynamically, ensuring every visit delivers practical, effective, and tailored support.
        </p>

        <div class="grid gap-4 md:grid-cols-2 mt-8 text-sm md:text-base text-[#1e2f23]/90">
          <div class="p-4 bg-[#f4f6f4] rounded-xl border border-[#607264]/10">
            <strong>Foundational Intake & Health Baseline:</strong> In-depth review of your health history, current health story, and ordering your Foundational Lab Panel.
          </div>
          <div class="p-4 bg-[#f4f6f4] rounded-xl border border-[#607264]/10">
            <strong>Functional Lab Review & Custom Protocol:</strong> Deep-dive analysis of your results and creation of your customized diet, mineral, and gut-restorative plan.
          </div>
          <div class="p-4 bg-[#f4f6f4] rounded-xl border border-[#607264]/10">
            <strong>Limiting Belief Reframing & Habit Architecture:</strong> Identifying core internal blocks, setting up habit-stacking frameworks, and designing easy-to-automate health rituals.
          </div>
          <div class="p-4 bg-[#f4f6f4] rounded-xl border border-[#607264]/10">
            <strong>Gut Health & Microbiome Restoration:</strong> Rebalancing digestive capacity, addressing dysbiosis, and strengthening gut barrier integrity.
          </div>
          <div class="p-4 bg-[#f4f6f4] rounded-xl border border-[#607264]/10">
            <strong>Mineral & Energy Optimization:</strong> Re-evaluating stamina, monitoring ferritin and electrolyte levels, and refining metabolic repletion strategies.
          </div>
          <div class="p-4 bg-[#f4f6f4] rounded-xl border border-[#607264]/10">
            <strong>Hormone & Rhythmic Alignment:</strong> Tailoring support for premenstrual symptoms, cycle regularity, fertility goals, perimenopausal shifts, or tuning into broader natural cycles and seasonal shifts.
          </div>
          <div class="p-4 bg-[#f4f6f4] rounded-xl border border-[#607264]/10">
            <strong>Recalibrating Balance & Pleasure:</strong> Evaluating the flow of giving vs. receiving, working vs. resting, and consciously expanding space for joy and restorative pleasure.
          </div>
          <div class="p-4 bg-[#f4f6f4] rounded-xl border border-[#607264]/10">
            <strong>Nervous System Rewiring:</strong> Learning vagus nerve techniques, stress modulation routines, and home lymphatic drainage.
          </div>
          <div class="p-4 bg-[#f4f6f4] rounded-xl border border-[#607264]/10">
            <strong>Pelvic & Core Integration:</strong> Assessing structural alignment and learning gentle self-directed movement practices.
          </div>
          <div class="p-4 bg-[#f4f6f4] rounded-xl border border-[#607264]/10">
            <strong>Long-Term Vitality & Habit Automization:</strong> Securing long-term sustainability, refining your automated lifestyle routines, sleep hygiene, and ongoing resilience protocols.
          </div>
        </div>
      </section>

      <!-- INVESTMENT & SLIDING SCALE PRICING -->
      <section class="py-12 md:py-16 border-b border-[#607264]/10">
        <span class="text-xs uppercase tracking-[0.3em] text-[#607264] font-semibold">Accessible Care</span>
        <h2 class="text-2xl md:text-4xl font-bold mt-2 text-[#3c2f2f]">Investment & Sliding Scale Pricing</h2>
        <p class="mt-4 text-base md:text-lg text-[#1e2f23]/90 max-w-3xl">
          We are deeply committed to making holistic root-cause care as accessible as possible while ensuring the sustainability of our practice. To honor the diverse financial realities of our community, we offer a self-selected sliding scale pricing model based on financial capacity, income, and access to generational wealth.
        </p>

        <!-- Tier Guidelines -->
        <div class="grid gap-6 md:grid-cols-3 mt-8">
          <div class="p-6 rounded-2xl bg-[#f4f6f4] border border-[#607264]/10">
            <h3 class="font-bold text-[#3c2f2f] mb-2">Tier 1: Standard / Supported</h3>
            <p class="text-xs md:text-sm text-[#607264]">
              Select this rate if meeting your basic living expenses requires careful budgeting, or if paying our baseline rate would create financial hardship or strain.
            </p>
          </div>

          <div class="p-6 rounded-2xl bg-[#f4f6f4] border border-[#607264]/10">
            <h3 class="font-bold text-[#3c2f2f] mb-2">Tier 2: Sustaining (Base)</h3>
            <p class="text-xs md:text-sm text-[#607264]">
              Select this rate if your basic needs are consistently met, you have predictable income, and you can comfortably pay for wellness services without impacting your daily stability.
            </p>
          </div>

          <div class="p-6 rounded-2xl bg-[#f4f6f4] border border-[#607264]/10">
            <h3 class="font-bold text-[#3c2f2f] mb-2">Tier 3: Supporter / Redistribution</h3>
            <p class="text-xs md:text-sm text-[#607264]">
              If you are in the owning class, have comfortable disposable income, own assets, or hold wealth/generational security. This tier directly offsets cost barriers for community members.
            </p>
          </div>
        </div>

        <!-- Pricing Table -->
        <div class="mt-10 overflow-x-auto">
          <table class="w-full text-left border-collapse min-w-[600px]">
            <thead>
              <tr class="border-b border-[#607264]/20 text-[#3c2f2f] text-sm md:text-base">
                <th class="py-4 px-4 font-bold">Care Package Option</th>
                <th class="py-4 px-4 font-bold">Tier 1: Supported</th>
                <th class="py-4 px-4 font-bold">Tier 2: Sustaining</th>
                <th class="py-4 px-4 font-bold">Tier 3: Supporter</th>
              </tr>
            </thead>
            <tbody class="divide-y divide-[#607264]/10 text-xs md:text-sm text-[#1e2f23]/90">
              <tr>
                <td class="py-4 px-4 font-semibold">
                  Option 1: 6-Month Intensive<br/>
                  <span class="font-normal text-xs text-[#607264]">(6 Monthly 90-min Sessions + Full Lab Panel)</span>
                </td>
                <td class="py-4 px-4">
                  Paid in Full: $1,190<br/>
                  Monthly: $215/mo
                </td>
                <td class="py-4 px-4">
                  Paid in Full: $1,490 <span class="text-xs text-[#607264]">(Save $90)</span><br/>
                  Monthly: $265/mo
                </td>
                <td class="py-4 px-4">
                  Paid in Full: $1,990<br/>
                  Monthly: $350/mo
                </td>
              </tr>
              <tr>
                <td class="py-4 px-4 font-semibold">
                  Option 2: 12-Month Comprehensive<br/>
                  <span class="font-normal text-xs text-[#607264]">(12 Monthly 90-min Sessions + Full Lab Panel)</span>
                </td>
                <td class="py-4 px-4">
                  Paid in Full: $1,850<br/>
                  Monthly: $165/mo
                </td>
                <td class="py-4 px-4">
                  Paid in Full: $2,350 <span class="text-xs text-[#607264]">(Save $130)</span><br/>
                  Monthly: $210/mo
                </td>
                <td class="py-4 px-4">
                  Paid in Full: $2,950<br/>
                  Monthly: $260/mo
                </td>
              </tr>
            </tbody>
          </table>
        </div>
      </section>

      <!-- ADD-ONS & LAB CREDITS -->
      <section class="py-12 md:py-16">
        <div class="grid gap-8 md:grid-cols-2">
          <!-- Add Ons -->
          <div class="space-y-4">
            <h3 class="text-xl font-bold text-[#3c2f2f]">Custom Add-On Services for Local Clients</h3>
            <ul class="space-y-3 text-sm md:text-base text-[#1e2f23]/90">
              <li class="bg-[#f4f6f4] p-4 rounded-xl border border-[#607264]/10">
                <strong>Hands-On Bodywork Session (90 Min) — +$180/visit:</strong> Add full somatic bodywork (CST, Myofascial Release, Swedish, Hot Stone, Warm Towels, Moxibustion).
              </li>
              <li class="bg-[#f4f6f4] p-4 rounded-xl border border-[#607264]/10">
                <strong>Additional Consultation Visits — $150 / 90 min:</strong> Extra consultations beyond your scheduled monthly session.
              </li>
              <li class="bg-[#f4f6f4] p-4 rounded-xl border border-[#607264]/10">
                <strong>In-Home Visit Fee — +$50-100/visit:</strong> Home visits available for local clients (priced by distance).
              </li>
              <li class="bg-[#f4f6f4] p-4 rounded-xl border border-[#607264]/10">
                <strong>Advanced Testing Add-Ons (Optional):</strong> Specialized hormone/cortisol (DUTCH) or toxin panels added at out-of-pocket cost. Foundational panels can be re-run up to a year after closing sessions.
              </li>
            </ul>
          </div>

          <!-- Lab Credits & Billing -->
          <div class="space-y-4">
            <h3 class="text-xl font-bold text-[#3c2f2f]">Insurance & Provider Lab Credits</h3>
            <p class="text-sm md:text-base text-[#607264]">
              The base package price includes cash-pay lab costs ($330 Foundational Blood Panel + $350 GI-MAP).
            </p>
            <ul class="space-y-3 text-sm md:text-base text-[#1e2f23]/90">
              <li class="bg-[#f4f6f4] p-4 rounded-xl border border-[#607264]/10">
                <strong>Blood Work Credit:</strong> Deduct up to $330 if covered through Medi-Cal or ordered by your PCP under private insurance.
              </li>
              <li class="bg-[#f4f6f4] p-4 rounded-xl border border-[#607264]/10">
                <strong>GI-MAP Stool Analysis Credit:</strong> Deduct $350 if you opt out of specialized functional stool testing.
              </li>
            </ul>

            <div class="pt-2 text-xs md:text-sm text-[#607264] leading-relaxed">
              <strong>Terms & Billing Information:</strong> Monthly payment plans spread your investment evenly across your care period. Enrollingconstitutes a commitment to complete the 6 or 12-month series as agreed. Payments are processed monthly via our secure client portal. Discounts are available for cash payments across all three tiers.
            </div>
          </div>
        </div>
      </section>

    </div>
  </div>

  <footer class="mt-20 border-t border-[#607264]/10 bg-[#f4f6f4] text-center text-xs md:text-sm text-[#607264] py-8 px-6">
    <p>© 2026 Rooted Moon Medicinals. All Rights Reserved. Respecting the innate wisdom of the body.</p>
  </footer>
</BaseLayout>